### v-Mazz end-to-end flow for the IntelliJ HTTP Client (run the requests top to bottom).
### Demo logins (password Password@123): admin@vmazz.com, subadmin@vmazz.com, buyer@vmazz.com

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. ADMIN logs in  (saves the token as {{adminToken}})
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@vmazz.com", "password": "Password@123" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 2. ADMIN creates an item in the item master (leave itemCode out to have one generated)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "Premium Tea Powder 1 kg",
  "category": "GROCERIES",
  "subCategory": "Beverages",
  "brand": "v-Mazz Select",
  "description": "CTC tea powder",
  "specification": "Assam CTC, strong liquor, 1 kg pouch",
  "hsnCode": "0902",
  "uom": "KG",
  "unitPrice": 420.00,
  "mrp": 480.00,
  "taxPercent": 5,
  "availableQuantity": 300,
  "minOrderQuantity": 2
}

> {% client.global.set("newItemId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. ADMIN lists the company's items
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/items?category=GROCERIES
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. ADMIN creates a sub user
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Store Keeper", "email": "storekeeper@vmazz.com", "mobile": "9876500000", "password": "Password@123" }

### 5. A customer registers on the portal (saves {{buyerToken}})
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Priya Sharma",
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "organizationName": "Sharma Caterers"
}

> {% client.global.set("buyerToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 5b. ...or log in as the demo buyer
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "buyer@vmazz.com", "password": "Password@123" }

> {% client.global.set("buyerToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 6. Browse the storefront (no login needed)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/categories

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/items?category=GROCERIES&sort=price_asc

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalog/items?q=rice&inStockOnly=true

### 7. Add to cart (itemId 1 = Basmati rice in the demo data)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### 7b. Add the tea created in step 2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": {{newItemId}}, "quantity": 5 }

### 8. View the cart
GET {{host}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 9. Checkout: address + order details -> purchase order(s)  (use a future requiredDeliveryDate)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactName": "Priya Sharma",
  "contactPhone": "9876543210",
  "shippingAddress": {
    "addressLine1": "45, Gandhi Road",
    "addressLine2": "Near Central Market",
    "city": "Coimbatore",
    "state": "Tamil Nadu",
    "postalCode": "641001",
    "country": "India"
  },
  "paymentMethod": "COD",
  "requiredDeliveryDate": "2027-01-15",
  "buyerReference": "SC-PO-1001",
  "notes": "Deliver between 9 am and 12 noon"
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.orders[0].id); %}

### 10. Customer: my orders
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 10b. Customer: one order with item details
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 11. ADMIN: orders received
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/orders?status=PLACED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. ADMIN: confirm the order  (then PACKED, SHIPPED, DELIVERED)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### 13. Register a new supplier company with its admin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Green Farms Traders",
  "companyEmail": "info@greenfarms.example",
  "companyPhone": "9876512345",
  "address": { "addressLine1": "7, Market Yard", "city": "Madurai", "state": "Tamil Nadu", "postalCode": "625001", "country": "India" },
  "adminFullName": "Arun Kumar",
  "adminEmail": "arun@greenfarms.example",
  "adminPassword": "Password@123"
}
